    "created_at": "2023-03-08T06:30:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-08T06:30:00Z",
    "body": "So I looked a bit into this, I think this was trying to match the updated dialog focusing steps, notably this step:\r\n\r\n> If isModal is true and subject has the [autofocus](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-fe-autofocus) attribute, then set control to subject.\r\n\r\nI don't think we should follow the same pattern as dialog here. This is a step specific to modal dialogs, because they render the rest of the page inert, so it isn't relevant to popovers.\r\n\r\ncc @scottaohara @domenic as well for opinions.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
