    "updated_at": "2023-03-08T06:45:07Z",
    "body": "Ah, seems like Chromium doesn't use the focus delegate, but rather the autofocus delegate, in which case the ternary makes slightly more sense?\r\n\r\nStill though, the spec says to use the focus delegate, not the autofocus delegate.\r\n\r\n",
