    "updated_at": "2023-03-08T19:42:38Z",
    "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8998 cleans this up a bit.\r\n\r\nIt refers to the autofocus delegate directly (and adapts the definition a bit to match), and adds the extra step that Chromium does to matches to target the popover itself it has the autofocus attribute.",
