    "created_at": "2023-03-08T22:07:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:07:11Z",
    "body": "I tried using autofocus delegate instead of focus delegate in chromium and it didn't make any tests fail, so I'm generally supportive. I am [working on additional tests for shadowdom](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8998#discussion_r1130064608).\r\n\r\nI think that using autofocus delegate may also make it easier to account for nested autofocus popovers/dialogs which [I implemented but haven't specced yet](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/container_node.cc;l=1647-1654;drc=bec0ef46974cd9a6bc0f1f1ae34baa11913f77af).",
